# F2 test: moving a homeable extra axis out of range must fail.
#
# After homing, a B move beyond position_max (50) must fail while soft
# limits are enabled (default M211 S1).
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG extra_axis_declarative.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

# Home XYZ and the homeable B axis.
G28

# Moving B beyond position_max must fail with soft limits enabled.
G1 B100
